\n• Quadrant 2 - Schedule: Important but not urgent (high priority without immediate deadline).
\n• Quadrant 3 - Delegate: Urgent but not important (due soon with medium or low priority).
\n• Quadrant 4 - Eliminate: Neither urgent nor important (low priority without deadline).</string>
